# Plan Diagram Guidance

When writing plan files, add a diagram if it helps explain the architecture or flow.

- Prefer Mermaid diagrams (sequence, flowchart, or class) inside fenced blocks.
- Include an "Architecture Overview" section with the diagram when describing a system.
- Keep diagrams concise and focused on key components and interactions.
